{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"campfire","model_identifier":"campfire","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# campfire\n\nCampfire: a ring of stones with crossed logs, about 1 m across.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -18..18, y -1..23, z -18..18 units (1.01 x 0.69 x 1.00 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 33.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 36 x 24 x 36 (w x h x d), centred at x -0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): burning (flames in child group `flame`)\n- `embers`: burnt-down glowing embers and charred logs\n- `cold`: cold ash and charred logs\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 12, 0)\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 22, 0)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_bed_embers, glow_coal, glow_ember_a, glow_ember_b, glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_1_b, glow_flame_1_c, glow_flame_2, glow_flame_b, glow_flame_c, glow_flame_tongue\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_smoke` is on root: use it in every state (thin smoke from embers, none or wisps when cold).\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"stone0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[12.5,0.0,-2.5],"to":[17.5,3.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[38.5,60.0,43.5,63.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[44.5,60.0,49.5,63.0],"texture":0},"s